[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "やったな、恋鐘\r\n三次審査合格したぞ！",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "004",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00002",
    "bgm": "006"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001050010,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ホントに！？\r\nいやったー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400105/7004001050010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これも普段から恋鐘が努力している結果だな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それに、最近の恋鐘のステージは\r\nなんだか前と違う気がする",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんというか……\r\n吹っ切れて恋鐘らしさがさらに出てきたと思う",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001050020,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そうなんよ！\r\nプロデューサーもわかってくれた？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400105/7004001050020"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001050030,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うち、今は最初にやってたころと\r\nステージに立つ感覚が全然違くてなー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400105/7004001050030"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001050040,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "今までは、歌や踊りを間違えないようにって\r\nずーっと気張ってたばってん……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400105/7004001050040"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001050050,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "けど、最近は\r\n失敗気にせんようにしたんよ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400105/7004001050050"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001050060,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "失敗することば怖がって\r\nちっちゃくなるのは、うちらしくないやん？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400105/7004001050060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、恋鐘の元気で一生懸命な姿を\r\nファンは見にきてるからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001050070,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うん、うち、プロデューサーにアドバイスもらって\r\n変われたと思う",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400105/7004001050070"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001050080,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "失敗してもよかけん\r\n自分の最高の演技をみんなに見せる……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_doya",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400105/7004001050080"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001050090,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "それが一番大事なんやって！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400105/7004001050090"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001050100,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そしたら、前にも増して\r\nライブがばり楽しくなってなー！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400105/7004001050100"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001050110,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うちが楽しんどるとファンのみんなも\r\nばり楽しそうにしてくれるとよ！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400105/7004001050110"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001050120,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ほんでまたうちも頑張ろ！　ってなって……\r\nもう、ホントいいことづくめよ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400105/7004001050120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか、恋鐘は自分のアイドルとしてのスタイルを\r\n確立できたんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001050130,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うん！　これもみんなプロデューサーのおかげよ！\r\nホントにありがとーね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400105/7004001050130"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001050140,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うち、これからもばり頑張るけん\r\nずーっとよろしゅうね！　プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400105/7004001050140"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]